Capability sentinel for the pro-test-workflow probe.

The probe executes committed fixtures under testdata/workflows/pro-test
through the real Ptah CLI. It exercises the Atlas Pro test verbs Ptah
implements as open capabilities (`atlas migrate test` and `atlas schema
test`, stokaro/ptah#805) against real SQLite dev databases: a passing
committed case set must exit 0 and a deliberately failing assertion must
exit 1 with a structured failure report. Atlas keeps both verbs in its
proprietary Pro/Cloud build — the pinned CE binary aborts on them — so
these fixtures are intentionally separate from the Atlas schema round-trip
corpus (stokaro/ptah#758).
